IndigoPlateau_Exterior_Text_MeowthGotTheTorch::
    .string "MEOWTH: Heh heh! We got it!\n"
    .string "Da real INDIGO TORCH!$"

IndigoPlateau_Exterior_Text_MeowthTwerpHere::
    .string "MEOWTH: Wha-?! Da twerp made it\n"
    .string "all da way to da LEAGUE?!$"

IndigoPlateau_Exterior_Text_JessieIndigoTorch::
    .string "JESSIE: Too late! The flame that\n"
    .string "opens every LEAGUE challenge is\l"
    .string "now TEAM ROCKET property!$"

IndigoPlateau_Exterior_Text_JamesNoChallenges::
    .string "JAMES: No torch, no challenge!\n"
    .string "The ELITE FOUR will have to close\l"
    .string "up shop. Ha ha ha!$"

IndigoPlateau_Exterior_Text_PikachuZapsTorch::
    .string "PIKACHU sprang forward and\n"
    .string "unleashed a THUNDERBOLT!$"

IndigoPlateau_Exterior_Text_WindGusts::
    .string "A strong wind swept down from\n"
    .string "the mountains!$"

IndigoPlateau_Exterior_Text_MeowthHotHotHot::
    .string "MEOWTH: The torch is flarin' up!\n"
    .string "Hot! Hot! Hot hot HOT!$"

IndigoPlateau_Exterior_Text_TorchLanded::
    .string "The INDIGO TORCH dropped neatly\n"
    .string "back into its stand by the door.\p"
    .string "Its flame burns on, brighter\n"
    .string "than before.$"

IndigoPlateau_Exterior_Text_OfficialThanks::
    .string "Thank you, young TRAINER!\n"
    .string "Without the torch, not a single\l"
    .string "challenge could have begun.\p"
    .string "Please accept this as thanks from\n"
    .string "the POKéMON LEAGUE.$"

IndigoPlateau_Exterior_Text_OfficialGoodLuck::
    .string "The ELITE FOUR await you inside.\n"
    .string "Good luck!$"

IndigoPlateau_Exterior_Text_JessieEarnTheTorch::
    .string "JESSIE: Want the torch? Then earn\n"
    .string "it, twerp!\p"
    .string "Before any CHAMPION, you get past\n"
    .string "TEAM ROCKET!$"

IndigoPlateau_Exterior_Text_RocketTorchDefeat::
    .string "JAMES: Our finest team, and still\n"
    .string "not enough…$"

IndigoPlateau_Exterior_Text_OfficialFireStone::
    .string "And this FIRE STONE as well.\p"
    .string "They say a spark from the INDIGO\n"
    .string "TORCH sleeps inside it.$"
